<rml><head><title>Pluto Combat / Deployment</title><link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss" /><link type="text/rcss" href="title.rcss" /><link type="text/rcss" href="settings.rcss" /></head>
<body><img id="menu-artwork" src="UI/Artwork/menu-background.tga" /><div id="title-screen">
<div id="masthead"><span class="brand">PLUTO <span class="accent">//</span> COMBAT</span><span class="ui-eyebrow">MULTIPLAYER OPERATIONS</span></div>
<div id="menu"><div class="ui-eyebrow accent">01 / OPERATIONS</div><div id="game-title" class="ui-heading">MULTIPLAYER</div>
<div class="menu-description">Choose your mission. Prepare for deployment.</div>
<div id="modes"><button tabindex="0" id="mode-hardpoint" class="ui-tab selected"><span class="mode-number">01</span> HARDPOINT <span class="mode-map">ARENA</span></button><button tabindex="1" id="mode-defusal" class="ui-tab"><span class="mode-number">02</span> DEFUSAL <span class="mode-map">FOUNDRY</span></button></div>
<div class="connection ui-panel"><div class="ui-eyebrow">OPERATOR / CONNECTION</div>
<div class="field-row"><label for="username">CALLSIGN</label><input tabindex="2" id="username" class="ui-field" type="text" value="Player" maxlength="20" /></div>
<div class="field-row"><label for="address">HOST ADDRESS</label><input tabindex="3" id="address" class="ui-field" type="text" value="127.0.0.1" maxlength="15" /></div></div>
<div id="actions"><button tabindex="4" id="host" class="ui-button primary">HOST GAME <span class="action-arrow">&gt;</span></button><button tabindex="5" id="join" class="ui-button">JOIN GAME</button></div>
<div id="status">Enter a username, then host or join a game.</div><div id="instructions" class="ui-meta">TAB NAVIGATE / ENTER SELECT</div></div>
<div id="mission-panel" class="ui-panel"><div class="ui-eyebrow">MISSION BRIEF / <span id="mission-location">ARENA</span></div><div id="mission-title" class="ui-heading">HOLD THE LINE</div><div id="mission-description">Capture the rotating hardpoint. Deny the enemy. Every second counts.</div>
<div class="mission-facts"><div><span class="ui-eyebrow">OBJECTIVE</span><div id="mission-rule">CAPTURE / HOLD</div></div><div><span class="ui-eyebrow">RESPAWN</span><div id="mission-life">ENABLED</div></div></div><div class="ui-rule" /><div class="ui-meta mission-note">BOTH PLAYERS MUST SELECT THE SAME MISSION</div><button id="graphics-preset" class="ui-button">SETTINGS</button></div>
<div id="title-footer"><span class="ui-meta">TACTICAL OPERATIONS / PLUTO COMBAT</span><span class="ui-eyebrow">GOOD INFORMATION WINS <span class="accent">//</span></span></div>
</div><div id="settings-overlay"><div id="settings-panel" class="ui-panel"><div class="ui-heading">SETTINGS</div><div class="settings-layout"><div class="settings-tabs"><button id="settings-tab-display" class="ui-tab selected">Display</button><button id="settings-tab-graphics" class="ui-tab">Graphics</button><button id="settings-tab-audio" class="ui-tab">Audio</button><button id="settings-tab-interface" class="ui-tab">Interface</button><button id="settings-tab-controls" class="ui-tab">Controls</button></div><div class="settings-content"><div id="settings-section-display" class="settings-section settings-active"><div class="settings-section-heading ui-eyebrow accent">DISPLAY</div><div class="settings-card"><div class="settings-card-info"><label for="setting-vsync" class="settings-card-label">VSync</label><div class="settings-card-description">Synchronize frames with your display.</div></div><div class="settings-card-control"><button id="setting-vsync" class="ui-button settings-toggle">OFF</button></div></div><div class="settings-card"><div class="settings-card-info"><label for="setting-fullscreen" class="settings-card-label">Borderless fullscreen</label><div class="settings-card-description">Fill the current monitor without window borders.</div></div><div class="settings-card-control"><button id="setting-fullscreen" class="ui-button settings-toggle">OFF</button></div></div></div><div id="settings-section-graphics" class="settings-section"><div class="settings-section-heading ui-eyebrow accent">GRAPHICS</div><div class="settings-card"><div class="settings-card-info"><label for="setting-quality" class="settings-card-label">Graphics quality</label><div class="settings-card-description">Choose a rendering quality preset.</div></div><div class="settings-card-control"><button id="setting-quality" class="ui-button settings-toggle">HIGH</button></div></div></div><div id="settings-section-audio" class="settings-section"><div class="settings-section-heading ui-eyebrow accent">AUDIO</div><div class="settings-card"><div class="settings-card-info"><label for="setting-master" class="settings-card-label">Master volume</label><div class="settings-card-description">Overall sound level.</div></div><div class="settings-card-control settings-slider-control"><span id="setting-master-value" class="setting-value">100%</span><input id="setting-master" class="settings-slider" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" value="1" /></div></div><div class="settings-card"><div class="settings-card-info"><label for="setting-effects" class="settings-card-label">Effects volume</label><div class="settings-card-description">Weapons, reloads, and gameplay sounds.</div></div><div class="settings-card-control settings-slider-control"><span id="setting-effects-value" class="setting-value">100%</span><input id="setting-effects" class="settings-slider" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" value="1" /></div></div><div class="settings-card"><div class="settings-card-info"><label for="setting-feedback" class="settings-card-label">Feedback volume</label><div class="settings-card-description">Hit markers and combat feedback.</div></div><div class="settings-card-control settings-slider-control"><span id="setting-feedback-value" class="setting-value">100%</span><input id="setting-feedback" class="settings-slider" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" value="1" /></div></div></div><div id="settings-section-interface" class="settings-section"><div class="settings-section-heading ui-eyebrow accent">INTERFACE</div><div class="settings-card"><div class="settings-card-info"><label for="setting-scale" class="settings-card-label">Interface scale</label><div class="settings-card-description">Adjust the size of menus and the HUD.</div></div><div class="settings-card-control settings-slider-control"><span id="setting-scale-value" class="setting-value">1.00x</span><input id="setting-scale" class="settings-slider" type="range" min="0.75" max="1.25" step="0.01" value="1" /></div></div></div><div id="settings-section-controls" class="settings-section"><div class="settings-section-heading ui-eyebrow accent">CONTROLS</div><div class="settings-card"><div class="settings-card-info"><label for="setting-mouse" class="settings-card-label">Mouse sensitivity</label><div class="settings-card-description">Aim speed multiplier; preserves ADS scaling.</div></div><div class="settings-card-control settings-slider-control"><span id="setting-mouse-value" class="setting-value">1.00x</span><input id="setting-mouse" class="settings-slider" type="range" min="0.1" max="3" step="0.05" value="1" /></div></div></div></div></div><div id="settings-status">Changes apply and save immediately.</div><button id="settings-reset" class="ui-button">RESTORE DEFAULTS</button><button id="settings-close" class="ui-button primary">BACK</button></div></div></body></rml>